work.","type":"text"}],"id":"6b8c49cb-22c6-4340-8435-3cf693e9519a","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"id":"e0556f24-04f1-476d-a02d-5d9d0108601a","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"3. 🔵 Sysco LABS Positioning","type":"text"}],"id":"67332c9d-e839-4f87-bbee-2ed107d95d42","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":2,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Company Context","type":"text"}],"id":"fff58913-4f57-4dbb-8acc-83220af9521f","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Sysco LABS is the technology hub for Sysco Corporation, one of the world''s largest foodservice distributors. The data engineering work supports ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"supply chain operations, inventory management, sales analytics, and logistics","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — real-world operational data with direct business impact.","type":"text"}],"id":"50726f3a-8b21-43f2-b856-782ce0c159bb","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"What They Value Most","type":"text"}],"id":"8a9476a6-76be-4257-b609-de87f42d15b1","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"SQL depth","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Data warehousing and reporting are core","type":"text"}],"id":"e13e72da-291d-44bd-9ce4-c5527faa36dd","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Practical engineering","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Production-ready systems over academic exercises","type":"text"}],"id":"e0e9f626-bfe9-46ef-a3a6-27b61e246691","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Business-aware thinking","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Understanding that the data feeds actual supply chain decisions","type":"text"}],"id":"e5322277-c67c-4be6-b4a4-d63b54386558","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Data modeling discipline","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Clean schemas, ER diagrams, star/snowflake understanding","type":"text"}],"id":"f49cba68-9741-4fe5-80ee-3b408136972b","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Python for pipelines","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — ETL scripting, automation","type":"text"}],"id":"dba46524-654b-43c1-899b-156dea1df60b","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"id":"740018e1-03bd-43f4-9583-f7c4eaf3b5f6","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"📝 Positioning Statement for Sysco LABS","type":"text"}],"id":"780d4856-02dd-4361-b7c0-e03703abd5d9","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I''m drawn to Sysco LABS because the data engineering work sits at the intersection of real operational data and business impact. My foundation in SQL, Python, and data modeling — especially around data warehousing and structured schemas — aligns well with the kind of supply chain and inventory analytics work Sysco does. I want my first industry experience to be in an environment where data reliability matters because it feeds actual logistics decisions, and Sysco LABS is exactly that.\"","type":"text"}],"id":"a86c49ca-740a-4e5f-b145-386cb8d48da0","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"id":"14764ac8-4866-4556-bdbf-5b23a20813ac","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🎯 Project Examples to Emphasize","type":"text"}],"id":"a8e3b3e7-3b15-47e9-89c3-7d52e93939a7","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"When discussing your projects at Sysco LABS, tilt toward:","type":"text"}],"id":"a35589e4-e895-46ca-b542-de17c61ba940","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Project Aspect","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"How to Frame It","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Database schema design","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I designed a normalized schema with fact and dimension tables for sales data — similar to how supply chain data would be structured for inventory reporting.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"SQL-heavy projects","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"The transformation layer was entirely SQL-based — I wrote queries to aggregate daily sales, calculate running totals, and handle late-arriving records.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Data quality","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I added validation checks to ensure incoming records matched expected formats — critical when downstream reports depend on data accuracy.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Business context","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"The pipeline fed a dashboard used by the business team to track weekly sales trends — the data had to be reliable and on time.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]}],"type":"tableContent"},"id":"389c514b-35ab-49ed-b934-efe48b57002c","props":{"textColor":"default"},"type":"table"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"What NOT to emphasize:","type":"text"}],"id":"26469681-ab03-410c-8f16-b3b05df5393e","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Machine learning models","type":"text"}],"id":"efa865db-dd1f-49f6-981f-a22f53d7cc19","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Real-time streaming (unless asked)","type":"text"}],"id":"ddf06fe3-c381-433f-b17a-5330af3ea141","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Cloud-native architectures you haven''t used","type":"text"}],"id":"934478fd-31dc-4ed7-b3f3-d217e4396bc2","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"id":"6c245de3-7d06-4441-9df6-3c5424fa201a","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"📚 Concepts to Revise Before Sysco LABS Interview","type":"text"}],"id":"5c3d3ca6-300a-4a07-9a6d-fa584d4ec94e","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Priority","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Concept","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Why It Matters","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🔴 High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"conten