ting ETL pipelines or building new reporting schemas?\"","type":"text"}],"id":"00bc769d-04f4-4046-8312-a1b1c7c36cf6","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"id":"da8f71f7-263c-4d8c-869e-ef52578783fc","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🚫 Mistakes to Avoid at Sysco LABS","type":"text"}],"id":"e4cbe09f-c2e3-4966-978d-c5d70bb82756","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Mistake","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Why It Hurts","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Fix","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Emphasizing ML/AI","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Sysco LABS DE is about pipelines and warehouses, not ML","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Focus on SQL, ETL, data quality","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"No business context","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Supply chain data exists for operational decisions","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Always connect your work to who uses the output","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Weak SQL","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"SQL is central to their stack","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Be ready to write and explain queries confidently","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Ignoring data quality","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Operational systems depend on clean, reliable data","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Show you think about validation and edge cases","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]}],"type":"tableContent"},"id":"7371cd90-3c3a-4987-b6f6-ab61023bc88e","props":{"textColor":"default"},"type":"table"},{"children":[],"id":"3c127cd9-a154-4751-8598-85f5bb975895","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"4. 🟡 EY GDS Positioning","type":"text"}],"id":"45792765-bf53-4cc7-88fc-db372fea6079","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":2,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Company Context","type":"text"}],"id":"df0c405a-d2f9-48a5-8808-6e94d8662e65","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"EY Global Delivery Services is the global technology and analytics arm of EY. The data engineering work supports ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"analytics transformation projects for enterprise clients","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" across industries — often involving ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"cloud data platforms, medallion architecture (Bronze/Silver/Gold), modern ETL/ELT workflows, and client-facing problem solving","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":".","type":"text"}],"id":"3543381b-4d50-4170-8b51-f2864796ba2f","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"What They Value Most","type":"text"}],"id":"e9e32f96-99c2-463d-8bb1-0abc1e7dd2b1","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Client-quality work","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Professional, documented, well-structured solutions","type":"text"}],"id":"bbce49eb-778a-4160-b63c-ef5283d8cae1","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Cloud and modern DE awareness","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Azure, AWS, data lakes, lakehouse patterns","type":"text"}],"id":"de317c58-2c48-4647-bcc9-bb543da6760a","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Medallion Architecture thinking","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Bronze → Silver → Gold data layers","type":"text"}],"id":"c07518bf-b1aa-4bbd-9656-8b6a6c385621","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"ETL/ELT fluency","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Understanding when to transform before vs. after loading","type":"text"}],"id":"42655518-272a-4736-b623-8ebdceb430d2","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Scenario-based reasoning","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Can you think through client requirements and propose solutions?","type":"text"}],"id":"51c58332-3498-45fe-8235-9b65b02f60f9","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Communication","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — You will interact with clients and cross-functional teams","type":"text"}],"id":"8b36de6b-a6d1-4050-828f-f665bc60d047","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"id":"6d4638fa-675c-41f0-85f6-4cafc49f16f6","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"📝 Positioning Statement for EY GDS","type":"text"}],"id":"6c2c0e42-55e1-4600-8be1-06549aea0f77","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I''m drawn to EY GDS because the data engineering work operates at the intersection of technical depth and client impact. The analytics transformation projects you handle — building layered data architectures like Bronze, Silver, and Gold for enterprise clients — are exactly the kind of structured, high-quality engineering I want to develop in. My foundation in ETL principles, SQL, and Python gives me a starting point, and I''m eager to learn cloud-native workflows and modern data platform design in a professional services environment where communication and quality matter as much as technical skill.\"","type":"text"}],"id":"20dc1991-d5a6-47ba-9ff6-b7ecadd14a19","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"id":"d951efc4-0d66-46ac-b06b-5e9cbcdbb8a5","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🎯 Project Examples to Emphasize","type":"text"}],"id":"4f60fbeb-1554-46d0-bda2-125ecada8e4c","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"When discussing your projects at EY GDS, tilt toward:","type":"text"}],"id":"f09b5eef-2fe0-416b-8cea-b99f656d0867","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Project Aspect","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"How to Frame It","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Layered data design","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I structured the pipeline with a raw staging layer and a transformed output layer — similar to the Bronze/Silver separation in medallion architecture.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"ETL/ELT awareness","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I transformed the data before loading because the destination was a simple PostgreSQL instance. In a cloud warehouse like BigQuery, I''d consider ELT for faster ingestion.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Data quality + documentation","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I documented every transformation decision and added row-count validation between stages — critical for client-facing work.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Scenario thinking","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"The pipeline was designed for daily batch loads, but if the requirement shifted to real-time, I''d approach it by introducing a message broker and micro-batch processing.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]}],"type":"tableContent"},"id":"c4b31d6c-115d-4116-97c9-65641372ebe1","props":{"textColor":"default"},"type":"table"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"What NOT to emphasize:","type":"text"}],"id":"72b6fd03-b882-4595-9742-f6bbc2521c0f","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Local, non-scalable setups without acknowledging how you''d scale","type":"text"}],"id":"0d62f9aa-cea7-4105-9037-a86ac1b2c47f","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Projects with no documentation or structure","type":"text"}],"id":"1699a723-3254-4599-97e1-244171a9b04a","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"id":"bdb6ef76-c85c-4368-9352-7fe2b6369fe5","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"📚 Concepts to Revise Before EY GDS Interview","type":"text"}],"id":"9a6fef73-8728-4494-ac7f-9f7ce1eb7368","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Priority","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Concept","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Why It Matters","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🔴 High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Medallion Architecture (Bronze/Silver/Gold)","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Core to EY''s modern data platform work","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🔴 High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"ETL vs ELT","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Key decision point in cloud architectures","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🔴 High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Data lake vs data warehouse","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Fundamental modern DE concept","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🔴 High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Star schema","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Analytics modeling","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🟡 Medium","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Spark basics","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Distributed processing awareness","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🟡 Medium","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Cloud platforms (Azure/AWS)","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Conceptual awareness, not deep hands-on","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🟡 Medium","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Batch vs streaming","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Architectural trade-offs","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🟢 Lower","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Specific telecom use cases","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Less relevant than general analytics transformation","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]}],"type":"tableContent"},"id":"933be4f1-c7de-466c-b335-0a461a47354d","props":{"textColor":"default"},"type":"table"},{"children":[],"id":"a7cfdbea-457a-423a-a76d-103dd459d18a","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"❓ Questions to Ask at EY GDS","type":"text"}],"id":"831503bf-8029-4eeb-b1c4-cfa478793742","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"Since EY GDS works on analytics transformation projects for diverse clients, how are interns typically onboarded? Do we start with internal sandbox environments or get exposure to live client architectures?\"","type":"text"}],"id":"b1a6b948-5aad-4cea-a40e-b52763b272b6","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"In a professional services environment with tight client deadlines, how does the team balance delivering on time with mentoring junior engineers?\"","type":"text"}],"id":"0e8f95c3-1255-4fff-b158-931f98594ec0","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"What does the data engineering stack typically look like at EY GDS? Are most projects cloud-native on Azure or AWS, or does it vary by client?\"","type":"text"}],"id":"55954dab-fd41-4de0-8f57-7f37ce292230","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"id":"379414c6-595e-4256-a4e7-f4c63f6a99ec","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🚫 Mistakes to Avoid at EY GDS","type":"text"}],"id":"10228770-7897-4b90-9661-363c81199268","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Mistake","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Why It Hurts","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Fix","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"No cloud awareness","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"EY''s work is heavily cloud-based","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Show conceptual understanding of data lakes, cloud warehouses","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Poor communication","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Client-facing work requires clarity","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Practice explaining concepts simply","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"No layered thinking","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Medallion Architecture is central","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Show you understand Bronze/Silver/Gold separation","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Ignoring documentation","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Professional services require documented decisions","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Mention documentation in your project explanations","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]}],"type":"tableContent"},"id":"24473383-29af-409f-8b15-a997bd183fcc","props":{"textColor":"default"},"type":"table"},{"children":[],"id":"14bc592b-9d54-46ed-98fb-ee307743820d","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"5. 🔴 Dialog Axiata Positioning","type":"text"}],"id":"b0c33057-2927-48fe-89db-f51084bb4273","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":2,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Company Context","type":"text"}],"id":"e382e90d-1e5f-4c89-b43c-77f394017587","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Dialog Axiata is Sri Lanka''s largest mobile network operator and a leading digital telco in South Asia. The data engineering work deals with ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"telecom-scale data volumes","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — billions of events from network operations, call detail records (CDRs), usage logs, and real-time monitoring. The environment demands ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"high reliability, large-scale processing, and awareness of streaming vs. batch trade-offs","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":".","type":"text"}],"id":"0f5e76f6-dc10-4fa5-a557-fa4723198dad","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"What They Value Most","type":"text"}],"id":"93b1abde-5065-4f55-8bd8-bd51017306ee","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Scale awareness","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Billions of records, not thousands","type":"text"}],"id":"715fc02e-f8ab-4662-b0d2-9b1088221663","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Reliability","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Telecom infrastructure can''t afford silent pipeline failures","type":"text"}],"id":"f6c743fe-aaa7-4184-a146-9e3248f54fe1","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Spark awareness","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Distributed processing for large datasets","type":"text"}],"id":"9255f2d1-05c3-4432-ab6a-46dd93e8800a","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Streaming/pub-sub concepts","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Event-driven data from network devices","type":"text"}],"id":"82d288ba-d269-4ad9-9232-6d7162c256be","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Failure handling","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — What happens when things break?","type":"text"}],"id":"e40af10d-e153-4427-89ef-c8dd4af93036","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Performance thinking","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — Partitioning, indexing, efficient queries","type":"text"}],"id":"7b7279ea-c578-44c5-ad1f-385a0bef003e","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"id":"00895087-8c52-40c3-b337-5e0539cd68bf","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"📝 Positioning Statement for Dialog Axiata","type":"text"}],"id":"2c3c18a3-b66a-4c5f-9fcc-965587e2d3b5","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I''m drawn to Dialog Axiata because the data engineering challenges in a telecom environment are fundamentally different from most industries — you''re dealing with billions of network events, CDRs, and usage logs that are both high-volume and operationally critical. That kind of scale forces disciplined engineering — reliable pipelines, efficient processing, and thoughtful failure handling. My foundation in SQL, Python, and batch pipeline design gives me a starting point, and I''m actively building awareness of distributed processing and streaming architectures because I understand that at Dialog''s scale, those aren''t optional — they''re essential.\"","type":"text"}],"id":"6e6e65c7-136e-46b8-8f31-c23f7e2741db","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"id":"f80c2e49-6da1-486b-839c-bb36ce7d8c01","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🎯 Project Examples to Emphasize","type":"text"}],"id":"23e829ab-4b03-4995-978f-0e58b09dd651","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"When discussing your projects at Dialog Axiata, tilt toward:","type":"text"}],"id":"d6f267e1-a23c-49de-b674-d83de219577a","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Project Aspect","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"How to Frame It","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Scale thinking","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"My project handled 50,000 daily records — modest scale, but I designed with partitioning and indexing in mind because I know at telecom scale, every inefficiency multiplies.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Reliability + idempotency","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I designed the load step to be idempotent using upsert logic, so pipeline reruns are safe. At Dialog''s scale, a non-idempotent pipeline could corrupt billions of records.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Failure handling","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"I added logging and row-count validation at each stage. If the pipeline fails, I know exactly where and can reprocess from that point without starting over.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Batch vs streaming awareness","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"This was a daily batch pipeline because real-time wasn''t required. If the requirement were network anomaly detection, I''d shift to a streaming architecture with Kafka and Spark Streaming.\"","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]}],"type":"tableContent"},"id":"691d1960-2f6b-4f59-8ad4-8671ab013c44","props":{"textColor":"default"},"type":"table"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"What NOT to emphasize:","type":"text"}],"id":"ad2b257b-92be-40a3-98a9-c6309938ea73","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Small academic datasets without acknowledging scale differences","type":"text"}],"id":"2412d367-0064-4a36-8da6-813cde4007eb","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"No awareness of distributed processing","type":"text"}],"id":"c7c333e5-ff9c-4783-825f-4bf0f3368767","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"id":"b27d6a67-de89-46aa-8776-6f10e8703de1","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"📚 Concepts to Revise Before Dialog Axiata Interview","type":"text"}],"id":"17bf2d26-be66-4d42-a3d2-0092ed9c441d","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Priority","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Concept","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Why It Matters","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🔴 High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Spark basics","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Distributed processing is essential at telecom scale","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🔴 High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Batch vs streaming","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Critical architectural decision","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🔴 High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Partitioning","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Performance at scale depends on it","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🔴 High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Idempotency","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Pipeline reruns must be safe","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🟡 Medium","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Streaming concepts (Kafka/pub-sub)","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Event-driven architecture awareness","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🟡 Medium","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Failure handling","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Reliability is non-negotiable","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🟡 Medium","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Event data / CDRs","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Telecom-specific data patterns","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🟢 Lower","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Client-facing communication","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Less critical than technical depth","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]}],"type":"tableContent"},"id":"f2def54d-d9a8-467a-b3da-3f9bff9ec8aa","props":{"textColor":"default"},"type":"table"},{"children":[],"id":"47f9f9ef-7497-4595-bb6b-5cacc905cffb","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"❓ Questions to Ask at Dialog Axiata","type":"text"}],"id":"fc66f8e0-185c-4273-9abe-105ce0405088","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"Dealing with telecom-scale data like CDRs and network logs, do junior engineers typically work on the batch processing side, or is there exposure to the real-time streaming pipelines as well?\"","type":"text"}],"id":"c89c8de5-364a-4b2b-b361-944b2f77fc9f","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"How does the data engineering team ensure pipeline reliability given that telecom infrastructure depends on accurate, timely data?\"","type":"text"}],"id":"1aadec64-3d9d-48bb-a36e-13a0e8095dae","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"italic":true},"text":"\"What does the data stack look like at Dialog for handling billions of daily events? Is it primarily Spark-based, or are there other distributed processing tools in use?\"","type":"text"}],"id":"9b35b775-097b-4237-a8e3-28811829032d","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default"},"type":"quote"},{"children":[],"id":"44eec7f7-6203-400c-a76d-ec6937c118fc","props":{},"type":"divider"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"🚫 Mistakes to Avoid at Dialog Axiata","type":"text"}],"id":"a63ebebe-8fac-423a-9ab4-21bb2e35a3ba","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Mistake","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Why It Hurts","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"t