d account analytics","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"High","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Low-medium","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Low","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"2–3 weeks","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]}],"type":"tableContent"},"id":"11a837c5-884a-4424-bbd0-b64328788d21","props":{"textColor":"default"},"type":"table"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"My mentor recommendation is the first theme: ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"foodservice order-to-delivery analytics warehouse","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":". It matches Sysco’s public business model most closely because it naturally brings together digital ordering, category-level products, customer accounts, pricing, warehouse fulfillment, delivery performance, and KPI reporting in one story. Public Sysco and Sysco LABS material supports exactly that mix. citeturn1view0turn2view1turn0search11turn0search5turn10view0turn8view1","type":"text"}],"id":"a05d6db1-7a9b-4088-a981-acfed219e12a","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Decision I need to make:\nWhich Sysco-inspired project theme should I choose?\n\nOptions:\n1. Foodservice order-to-delivery analytics warehouse\n2. Demand and inventory health pipeline\n3. Customer ordering behavior analytics\n\nRecommended option:\nFoodservice order-to-delivery analytics warehouse\n\nWhy it is recommended:\nIt best matches Sysco’s public business context and lets me show multiple data engineering skills in one project: source simulation, ETL/ELT, modeling, data quality, KPI design, and BI.\n\nWhat I must understand before choosing:\nI need to keep version 1 focused. “Order-to-delivery” does not mean building every possible table. It means one coherent pipeline with a clear core fact grain and a small number of high-value KPIs.\n\nInterview defense question:\nWhy did you choose this business problem?\n\nMy final choice:\n[leave blank for me]","type":"text"}],"id":"496ba545-5e78-43f3-9e32-b1611a426449","props":{"language":"python"},"type":"codeBlock"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Dataset options","type":"text"}],"id":"95085e2e-f0d1-4dca-aeca-2f3cdbb0e10e","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"A strong strategy here is ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Option A: one strong dataset split into multiple simulated sources","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":". That is usually better than forcing together several incompatible open datasets in a 3–4 week project.","type":"text"}],"id":"2f5900f6-0942-47ec-9cb6-bcc436c56166","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":{"columnWidths":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"headerRows":1,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Dataset","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Source link","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"What it contains","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Key columns you can use","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Business relevance to a Sysco-style scenario","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"License or usability notes","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Main limitations","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"},{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Can map into source systems?","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"tableCell"}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Instacart Market Basket Analysis","type":"text"}],"props":{"backgroundColor":"default","colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"textAlignm