_Key = dt.Date_Key\nWHERE dt.Year = 2026\nGROUP BY d.Name, p.Category;","type":"text"}],"id":"c595269a-14af-4c93-be40-99715da04a59","props":{"language":"text"},"type":"codeBlock"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"backgroundColor":"color(srgb 0.0901961 0.0862745 0.0823529)","textColor":"rgb(214, 213, 212)"},"text":"This query ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"answers a complex business question","type":"text"},{"styles":{"backgroundColor":"color(srgb 0.0901961 0.0862745 0.0823529)","textColor":"rgb(214, 213, 212)"},"text":" (who bought what category and how much did they spend in 2026) using simple, readable SQL.","type":"text"}],"id":"edefe941-8688-4766-9744-c0ecfb259b86","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"🌾 The Concept of Grain","type":"text"}],"id":"4331e70d-3608-4ac0-a266-640210a65832","props":{"backgroundColor":"color(srgb 0.0901961 0.0862745 0.0823529)","isToggleable":false,"level":2,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"rgb(214, 213, 212)"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Before building any dimensional model, the data engineer must declare the ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"grain","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — the atomic level of detail that one row in the fact table represents.","type":"text"}],"id":"b6fd2250-ed26-441d-9765-47b9fbe55871","props":{"backgroundColor":"color(srgb 0.0901961 0.0862745 0.0823529)","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"rgb(214, 213, 212)"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Fine grain:","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" One row = one individual product line on one order","type":"text"}],"id":"6aff550f-8b47-4694-9d5b-058b0aa7f8b2","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bol