le: Placing ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"code":true},"text":"User_ID","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" inside the ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"code":true},"text":"Orders","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" table to link an order to its buyer","type":"text"}],"id":"2b440776-c9dc-418b-ad1f-ad43aec3f050","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Users Table                Orders Table              Products Table\n-----------                ------------              --------------\nUser_ID (PK) ──────────► User_ID (FK)     ◄──────── Product_ID (PK)\nName                      Order_ID (PK)              Name\nAddress                   Order_Date                 Quantity\n                          Product_ID (FK) ───────────►","type":"text"}],"id":"a019ba2f-3192-476b-840d-3b35df8f2037","props":{"language":"text"},"type":"codeBlock"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"🔧 Application — Designing Before Building","type":"text"}],"id":"17f717f2-f4f8-4cb1-95d7-2d45878ac2ca","props":{"backgroundColor":"color(srgb 0.0901961 0.0862745 0.0823529)","isToggleable":false,"level":2,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"rgb(214, 213, 212)"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Whenever a ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Database Administrator (DBA)","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"data engineer","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" designs a new system, they map out relationships visually using tools like:","type":"text"}],"id":"099175a6-792a-4c63-b5f0-558abecaf12e","props":{"backgroundColor":"color(srgb 0.0901961 0.0862745 0.0823529)","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"rgb(214, 213, 212)"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"draw.io","type":"text"}],"href":"http://draw.io","type":"link"},{"styles":{},"text":" — free diagramming tool","type":"text"}],"id":"c8bddc64-c117-453c-9d61-c817bffdf474","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"dbdiagram.io","type":"text"}],"href":"http://dbdiagram.io","type":"link"},{"styles":{},"text":" — dedicated database diagram tool","type":"text"}],"id":"9c6b573a-fd6a-4264-b4d5-0d6585c87198","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Lucidchart","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" — collaborative ER diagram builder","type":"text"}],"id":"98f9c01b-4fc1-4a72-97c1-9f6dbef03ff8","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"This upfront design ensures that when a front-end application generates data, the database is ","type":"text"},{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"perfectly structured to receive, store, and join it","type":"text"},{"styles":{},"text":" for downstream analysis.","type":"text"}],"id":"f2013071-f01b-4cfc-81a9-aa5b8a617983","props":{"backgroundColor":"color(srgb 0.0901961 0.0862745 0.0823529)","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"rgb(214, 213, 212)"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"💡 Real-World Example — E-Commerce Blueprint (Amazon)","type":"text"}],"id":"963b9534-e5c5-456a-a36e-95ac5feacca7","props":{"backgroundColor":"color(srgb 0.0901961 0.0862745 0.0823529)","isToggleable":false,"level":2,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"rgb(214, 213, 212)"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{"bold":true},"text":"Step 1: Define the Tables","type":"text"}],"id":"72ea78bc-2b77-4155-a689-d84654abafee","props":{"backgroundColor":"color(srgb 0.0901961 0.0862745 0.0823529)","isToggleable":false,"level":2,"te