eams and customer-focused product work. That makes questions around warehousing, reporting workflows, operational data, and team collaboration especially strong here.","type":"text"}],"id":"40cb68d0-710c-409c-a0b5-0a2177f21db3","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Strong Sysco LABS questions","type":"text"}],"id":"13f01322-1415-4725-b4f4-5525e1ca84c2","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","isToggleable":false,"level":3,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"heading"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"How does the data team decide when to build a new data mart versus extending an existing one?","type":"text"}],"id":"283e139f-0ce9-4df5-a277-f2369366733b","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"For reporting around orders or deliveries, what does the workflow usually look like from raw data to dashboard-ready tables?","type":"text"}],"id":"92dda7a9-a94e-43c4-a7cb-592d8415e607","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"Is the role more focused on SQL modeling and reporting support, or more on Python-based pipeline work?","type":"text"}],"id":"8ed97ca9-b64f-4a64-acc3-d751549dd9ef","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"How closely do data engineers work with product or business teams when defining reporting needs?","type":"text"}],"id":"6b30b6a2-6619-416b-95f7-a4496bee604f","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","textColor":"default"},"type":"bulletListItem"},{"children":[],"content":[{"styles":{},"text":"What kinds of data quality issues are most common in customer, order, o